                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b458aa15-6d0f-4c16-891a-8f99e50687f9",
                                "sense_id": "532d6b2a-0692-32ab-8b08-8f28fa62de0c",
                                "text": "Она́ была́ проститу́тка, приговорённая к ка́торге, и, несмотря́ на э́то, она́ соста́вила себе́ тако́е мировоззре́ние, при кото́ром могла́ одо́брить себя́ и да́же горди́ться пе́ред людьми́ свои́м положе́нием.",
                                "translation": "She was a prostitute condemned to Siberia, and yet she had a conception of life which made it possible for her to be satisfied with herself, and even to pride herself on her position before others.",
                                "english": "She was a prostitute condemned to Siberia, and yet she had a conception of life which made it possible for her to be satisfied with herself, and even to pride herself on her position before others."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
